                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Fun puzzle game, that is probably too highly priced.\n\nYou have to cross a room, there are obstacles so you have to think your moves. \n\nYou have a katana to help you with the things in your way. \n\nPerformance is great, graphics are allright for what the game is trying to do.\n\nThe game is cleverly done, puzzles get challenging soon enough and require you to move siftly. \n\nI got this game on a sale or in a bundle i cant remember, i recommend it if you get it like that, because i dont think its worth it full price, but on a steep sale or as part of a bundle i think it would be a puzzler to take a look at.\n\n",
